{'symbol': 'NWS', 'date': '2023-01-24 16:30:00', 'title': "ANNOUNCEMENT BY NEWS CORP'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS ON POTENTIAL COMBINATION WITH FOX CORPORATION", 'text': "NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--NEWS CORPORATION (“NEWS CORP” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: NWS, NWSA; ASX: NWS, NWSLV) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS RECEIVED A LETTER FROM K. RUPERT MURDOCH WITHDRAWING THE PROPOSAL TO EXPLORE A POTENTIAL COMBINATION OF NEWS CORP AND FOX CORPORATION (“FOX”) (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX)."}